        <p style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:15px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 16px;max-width:460px;">The bump, reflow and underfill process window is developed and qualified before volume production, with X-ray and reliability data available as part of the qualification process.</p>
